Third-party UI algorithms
-------------------------

The dock, keymap, and palette modules include algorithms translated into
Python from repositories that grant the MIT License or the Apache License,
Version 2.0, at your option. VOXPrint distributes those translations under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. Names, logos, brand files, and fonts from
those projects are not included. Files under the GPL, the MPL, or no licence
were not copied. egui painters were not copied.

